{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13074","headline":"送彭偃房由赴朝因寄钱大郎中李十七舍人 · 郎士元","name":"送彭偃房由赴朝因寄钱大郎中李十七舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衰病已经年，西峰望楚天。\n风光欺鬓发，秋色换山川。\n寂寞浮云外，支离汉水边。\n平生故人远，君去话潸然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13074.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13074","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}